  DisplayName: A Royal Coin Cabinet Is Dispersed
  EventType: 1
  Description: A royal coin cabinet, formed over three reigns, {is being|will be}
    sold to settle the crown's debts. Thousands of coins {are coming|will come} to
    the rooms over the following weeks, and collectors who never hoped to see such
    pieces offered {are travelling|will travel} from abroad to bid.
